# Bug 06, witness B (the expels() FIXME, polyself.c:931): polymon() keeps
# running after a nested rehumanize().  This is the keystream recorded in
# session-expels.json.
#
# The ochre jelly is the only engulfer that is neither MZ_HUGE nor whirly
# (level 6, MZ_MEDIUM), so polymorphing into any MZ_LARGE+ form trips the
# size test at polyself.c:915-918 and expels() fires.  A rothe is the
# frailest such form (level 2, u.mhmax = d(2,8)).
#
# The damage comes from a land mine the hero sets under their own feet
# (set_trap, apply.c:2918).  It survives the engulf because gulpmu()
# moves the MONSTER onto the hero's square with place_monster() -- not
# mintrap() -- and explicitly zeroes mtmp->mtrapped.  expels() ends in
# spoteffects(TRUE), which fires the mine, and losehp() then reverts the
# rothe from inside polymon().
#
# dotrap() has a 1-in-5 escape roll for an already-seen trap
# (rn2(5) @ trap.c:3044); this seed rolls past it.
#
# Evidence: TWO d(2,10) @ touch_artifact(artifact.c:953) after one
# polymorph.  Control: seed4246 (same but a form too small to be
# expelled) has ONE.

seed: 4244
datetime: 20000110090000
nethackrc: |
  OPTIONS=name:r,role:Valkyrie,race:human,gender:female,align:neutral
  OPTIONS=playmode:debug
  OPTIONS=!autopickup
  OPTIONS=!tutorial
  OPTIONS=pettype:none
  OPTIONS=time,showexp

"\x1b#levelchange\n30\n                             "
"\x17The Eye of the Aethiopica\n "
"\x17ring of polymorph control\n"
"\x17wand of polymorph\n"
"\x17land mine\n"
"\x173 blessed potions of full healing\nPe PfrhFhFhFhah\x07ochre jelly\n20s 20s 20s 20s 20s 20s 20s   20s qizg.rothe\n        "
